      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SLICK SILAS (2) stalked the pace from a low draw last start and fought on well to finish 4.5 lengths away in third (22.89) at Gawler in a TG1-4W over 400m. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from six starts. Can find winning form. BUBBLE COASTER (1) has a strong record this trip with four wins and five placings from 12 starts. Missed the frame latest (23.36) when fourth over 400m at Gawler in a TG1-4W. Can feature with the right run. SOKAI (8) has been in super consistent form, finishing in the minors at his last four runs. Last start finished 2nd on October 8 over 395m at Murray Bridge behind Tony beaten 1.3 lengths (22.48) in a Grade 6. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. ADHANA REMI (4) scored with plenty to spare last time. Hard to beat again.",
